  "bio": "Claudio Comite is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Naples, Italy, who specializes in tribal and geometric designs. With an eye for clean, intricate lines and shapes, Claudio's clients are often wowed by the precision and detail found in each unique piece he creates. His portfolio, echoing with the mantra \"Only geometries...\", showcases a profound mastery of form and symmetry, making him a sought-after artist for anyone desiring a tattoo that harmoniously blends art with the ancient roots of tribal patterns.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Naples, Campania, Italy\n\nONLY GEOMETRIES...\nINFO: 🟢 3454009357 /08117763316",
